गौर॑ f. ई॑ white, yellowish, reddish;
 brilliant,
beautiful. m. = गौरमृग॑ or = गौरसर्षप, N. of a teacher;
 f.
ई a female buffalo, a young girl before puberty, E. of the wife of
Śiva, N. of sev. women.

गौरव a. relating to a Guru or teacher;
 n. weight,
heaviness, (prosodical) length;
 importance, gravity, authority, respect,
reverence.
